         <bool>true</bool>
        </property>
        <property name="plainText">
         <string>Indicator Description:
1.When the price is in a consolidation phase, buy when it pulls back to touch the support line; sell when it rallies to touch the resistance line.
2.In a sustained uptrend, the price advances along the ascending channel formed by the median line and the resistance line. When the price fails to touch the resistance line, the uptrend is losing momentum, and a sell signal is triggered.
3.In a sustained downtrend, the price declines along the descending channel formed by the median line and the support line. When the price fails to touch the support line, the downtrend is weakening, and a buy signal is triggered.</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
